## 1. How many werewolves are in the committee?

Draw a random committee of $t$ players from a village of $n$ with $k$ werewolves. The count
of werewolves follows the hypergeometric law $h(n,k,t,j)=\binom{k}{j}\binom{n-k}{t-j}/\binom{n}{t}$.
